@* ============================================================
   Home.razor — Welcome / Landing Page
   Route: /
   ============================================================ *@

@page "/"

<PageTitle>StudentBasics — Home</PageTitle>

<div class="container py-4">
    <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold">Welcome to StudentBasics 👋</h1>
    <p class="lead text-muted">
        A beginner Blazor app that demonstrates core concepts through a simple student management system.
    </p>

    <hr />

    <h4 class="mt-4">What you'll learn from this app:</h4>
    <ul class="list-group list-group-flush mb-4">
        <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Routing</strong> — @@page directives and URL parameters (e.g., /students/3)</li>
        <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Components</strong> — reusable <code>StudentCard</code> child component with [Parameter]</li>
        <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Events</strong> — EventCallback lets child components talk to their parent</li>
        <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Data binding</strong> — @@bind for two-way binding on inputs</li>
        <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Lists</strong> — @@foreach to render a list of students</li>
        <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Forms &amp; Validation</strong> — EditForm + DataAnnotations + ValidationMessage</li>
        <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Conditional rendering</strong> — @@if / @@else to show different UI based on state</li>
    </ul>

    <a href="/students" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">View Students →</a>
</div>
